<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo-banner">演示模式 · 不会登录真实微信共享服务</view><view class="eyebrow">让旅程，在不同设备继续</view><view class="heading">同行的你</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在查看账号…</view><block wx:if="{{user}}"><view class="card profile"><view class="row"><view class="avatar">旅</view><view><view class="card-title">{{user.displayName}}</view><text class="tiny">{{user.isBound?'已绑定网页版账号':'微信旅行空间'}}</text></view></view><block wx:if="{{!user.isBound}}"><text class="form-label">同行昵称</text><input class="input" value="{{name}}" maxlength="30" bindinput="name" placeholder="朋友们怎么称呼你？"/><view class="actions"><button class="button secondary" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="rename">保存昵称</button></view></block></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">{{user.isBound?'同一本账，已经连接':'绑定网页版账号'}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{user.isBound?'现在可以在微信和网页版继续记录同一段旅程。':'在网页版登录，点击「微信同步」生成绑定码，再到这里输入。'}}</view><block wx:if="{{!user.isBound}}"><text class="form-label">十位绑定码</text><input class="input code-input" value="{{code}}" maxlength="10" bindinput="code" placeholder="例如：ABCD2345EF"/><view class="help">绑定码十分钟有效。已有微信账本将合并，成员身份和分摊金额也会合并。</view><button class="button primary" disabled="{{saving || demo}}" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="bind">绑定并共享账本</button><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="help">注册 AppID 并配置云环境后，即可使用真实绑定与同步。</view></block><view class="actions"><button class="button secondary" bindtap="copyWeb">复制网页版地址</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">你的账本，成员可见</view><view class="help">旅行数据保存在共享后端，由服务端检查成员身份。邀请只用于加入；账单不会通过分享公开。</view></view><button wx:if="{{demo}}" class="button ghost" bindtap="resetDemo">重置本机演示数据</button></block></view>
